{"total_count":2,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1886","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1886/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1886/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1886/events","html_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1886","id":6369547215,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVgdJU88AAAABO4xf2Q","number":1886,"title":"Shackle a trailer's towing lug and lock the pin with one twist","user":{"login":"4idrossifenil-etanammide","id":80916951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTE2OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80916951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide","html_url":"https://github.com/4idrossifenil-etanammide","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4idrossifenil-etanammide/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-13T10:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:37:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/1886","html_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1886","diff_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1886.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1886.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds `tasks/trailer-towing-shackle/`.\n\nA small two-wheeled utility trailer stands on the table, its drawbar ending in a steel block with a towing lug toward the robot. A 1/2 in D shackle stands upright in a stand on the left; its red quick-lock pin stands in a holder on the right. One arm has to hold the loose shackle's two ears square around the lug while the other passes the pin through the upper ear, the lug's hole and into the lower ear (under 1 mm of play at each) and locks it with one twist.\n\n**Prompt:** \"Shackle the trailer's towing lug: the lug between the shackle's ears and the pin screwed home to lock it.\"\n\n**Scoring** (a look at the pin, marks on the eye and the ear, and the video): 0 if the shackle or the pin fell off the table, or the pin is not through the upper ear, the lug and into the lower ear. Else 1.0 if the pin is locked (turned at least 120° clockwise on its thread, or its collar seated within 1 mm), held 1 s; 0.5 if the thread has caught and the pin is turned at least 45°; 0.25 if the pin is through all three but not turned.\n\n- Simulator: Isaac Lab-Arena `yam_arena` on the calibrated station; rigid box parts and joints from `jointkit.py`. The videos are the station's top camera.\n- Category: Impact on jobs\n- Run limit: 1,200 steps\n- Scores: Dream-1 run: 0.0 (1,200 steps; both arms draw back toward their bases and never touch the shackle or the pin); demo: 1.0 (success after 550 steps)\n- Media: M-XSRL27\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/i